{"id":"n84022-1-7","stage":2,"title":"학용품 · 学习用品","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84022-1-7-1","ko":"학용품 다 챙겼어?","zh":"学习用品都带齐了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"학용품","meaning":"学习用品，文具","explanation":"학용품：学习用品，文具。","readings":[{"term":"학용품","audio":"/audio/34cbb8338d5f367fa94b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84022","senseId":"1","lemma":"학용품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학용품","audio":"/audio/34cbb8338d5f367fa94b.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"챙겼어?","meaning":"收拾，整理，准备","explanation":"챙기다：收拾，整理，准备；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"챙기다","audio":"/audio/39b299d8d470abe5d844.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29778","senseId":"1","lemma":"챙기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"챙겼어","audio":"/audio/8a5b39d7683c832ec5d9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"34cbb8338d5f367f","term":"학용품","zh":"学习用品，文具","audio":"/audio/34cbb8338d5f367fa94b.mp3","entryId":"84022","definition":"书写工具或笔记本等学习时需要的物品。","pronunciation":["하굥품"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"39b299d8d470abe5","term":"챙기다","zh":"收拾，整理，准备","audio":"/audio/39b299d8d470abe5d844.mp3","entryId":"29778","definition":"寻找所需之物并携带，或观察是否携带齐全。","pronunciation":["챙기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/11038d6bb196fcc8cd18.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n84022-1-7-2","ko":"공책이랑 필통, 준비물 다 가방에 넣었어요.","zh":"笔记本和笔袋，还有所有准备好的东西都放进包里了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"공책이랑","meaning":"笔记本","explanation":"공책：笔记本；이랑：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"공책","audio":"/audio/06bbecd00d0929ecc83f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15252","senseId":"1","lemma":"공책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공책이랑","audio":"/audio/a54096b033db73e74bd2.mp3"}},{"text":"필통,","meaning":"笔盒，笔匣","explanation":"필통：笔盒，笔匣。","readings":[{"term":"필통","audio":"/audio/e47e18551c74b1dc3381.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84661","senseId":"2","lemma":"필통","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"필통","audio":"/audio/e47e18551c74b1dc3381.mp3"}},{"text":"준비물","meaning":"准备物","explanation":"준비물：准备物。","readings":[{"term":"준비물","audio":"/audio/aff0371d971faf30d7b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86438","senseId":"1","lemma":"준비물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"준비물","audio":"/audio/aff0371d971faf30d7b6.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"가방에","meaning":"包，背包，提包","explanation":"가방：包，背包，提包；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"가방","audio":"/audio/6852b2954fc8556674f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18259","senseId":"1","lemma":"가방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가방에","audio":"/audio/fb3696def9a429e4fa7d.mp3"}},{"text":"넣었어요.","meaning":"放进，装进","explanation":"넣다：放进，装进；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"1","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넣었어요","audio":"/audio/13e1a848746da0ec8022.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"06bbecd00d0929ec","term":"공책","zh":"笔记本","audio":"/audio/06bbecd00d0929ecc83f.mp3","entryId":"15252","definition":"可以写字或画画，用白纸或划线纸系成的本子。","pronunciation":["공책"]},{"id":"e47e18551c74b1dc","term":"필통","zh":"笔盒，笔匣","audio